  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-one-little-bite-v7-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "e918e7568c078eb4b693c833290f899a925e577ab1a6a42a398dccb00122edbd",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f83f38b5bbde859998fdbea9d294edbc7a4e78197caf38cfc3e1b0c7e9771eae",
      "text": "悟空\n尝一小口",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fb63e75834665278f175f03568d004b0aeb1a056fa11cbe5073feba546b35cee",
      "text": "太阳慢慢落山了。\n悟空抱着他的桃子。\n“我只吃桃子！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "95b96888363ef109043624f5bd196732d075109a6691b09cba3058beb9f86694",
      "text": "“来帮忙做晚饭吧。”\n八戒说。\n悟空帮忙洗胡萝卜。\n哗啦！鼻子也湿了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "78d74601e2f041b521757289ada720924a16f33eac0559205ba5ef4e26d0e374",
      "text": "沙僧搅着锅里的菜。\n一片叶子落在\n悟空的桃子上。\n“我的桃子戴帽子啦！”\n他咯咯地笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d6dfb73ddcd6c0124c81699d85f0485c4f65f30dc620fde0fb19d97f36ad88c4",
      "text": "一股香味飘过来。\n“那是什么呀？”悟空问。\n“热乎乎的胡萝卜呀。”\n沙僧说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d533a143744170444b882c7d21179cd95e93cdf34fb348f99c51bccf6cdce48b",
      "text": "悟空尝了一小口。\n“哦！又甜又软。”\n他把桃子\n放在碗旁边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5cb7cf5213ad1692c67fe6de748080d972ff913883ab445ec3dd8ed64bad7da7",
      "text": "“再尝一口青菜？”\n悟空尝了一小片菜叶。\n“嗯……又软又多汁！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "862e9d52eb53fa88f3eea47f421d00d04761865fe5276089bd054d5508ba374d",
      "text": "他尝了米饭，\n还有小块小块的豆腐。\n这个尝一点，\n那个尝一点。\n“我的碗里有新朋友啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5c14a24ed4df0ff9d0dccb89b8cf100f5bef33f24f3b9c2d9c8847de63aef60b",
      "text": "月光洒在餐桌上。\n悟空吃完最后一口桃子。\n“我喜欢的不光是桃子啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "49ffbc7150c1149d5c67274d5a9bc4522c2fe3499be6634ff4a43f2ecae8d633",
      "text": "悟空钻进被窝。\n“晚安，小碗。\n晚安，朋友们。”\n明天，他还可以\n尝尝新东西。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8d2925b34f65683b4ac3a96f4d0a62c5669ce90c16387e750248f64252ac20",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n故事与插画使用 AI 辅助创作，由作者指导和编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
